---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const UPDATED = "15.10.2026";
const EMAIL = "info@chimaeracollective.dk";
---

<Base
  title={"Terms & conditions — CHIMAERA"}
  description={"Ticket terms for CHIMAERA events: buying tickets, refunds up to 48 hours before, cancellations and complaints."}
  path="/terms/"
  styles={["/css/page.css", "/css/legal.css"]}
  scripts={["/js/page-chrome.js"]}
>
<main id="main">

  <section class="page-intro page-intro--legal field-atmosphere" data-field="coral" aria-labelledby="terms-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">legal</p>
      <h1 id="terms-heading">terms &amp; conditions</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="legal field-atmosphere" data-field="coral">
    <div class="container legal__inner">

      <p class="legal__updated eyebrow">Last updated {UPDATED}</p>

      <section>
        <h2>Seller</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">
          CHIMAERA.CPH, CVR 45933091, Ved Linden 4, 3. th., 2300 Copenhagen S, Denmark, <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Buying tickets</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">
          Tickets are bought through our payment provider Stripe. Prices are in Danish kroner. Payment is taken at
          purchase. You receive a confirmation by email, which is your ticket.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Right of withdrawal</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">
          Tickets carry no 14-day right of withdrawal, because they are for a leisure event on a specific date
          (Danish Consumer Contracts Act, section 18(2)(xii)). Our refund rules below apply instead.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Refunds</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">
          You get a full refund if you cancel no later than 48 hours before the event starts. Email <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a> with your name and order confirmation. We refund to the same
          payment method within 14 days. Cancellations later than 48 hours before the start are not refunded.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Cancellations and changes</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">
          If we cancel an event, you automatically get a full refund. If we significantly change the date or
          venue, you can choose a full refund instead of attending.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Photos</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">
          We take photos at our events. See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for how photos are used and
          how to have one removed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Complaints</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">
          Contact us first at <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>. If we can't resolve it, you can complain to
          the Danish Centre for Complaint Resolution via <a href="https://www.forbrug.dk" rel="noopener">forbrug.dk</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">Danish law applies. Disputes are settled by the Danish courts.</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>

</main>
</Base>
